Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Page Revision|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteType|Blank|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|sitePagePrivacy|Public|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|pageVersioningEnabled|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	Then Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|Page Revision|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Reject Page Revision PG
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|pageName|Page Revision Page|
	When Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Staging submit For Publication Page Revision
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page view With Workflow PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|workflowStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|${pageName}|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page view With Workflow PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|workflowStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow reject Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|${pageName}|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow view Rejected Task
		|workflowAssetTitle|${pageName}|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page view With Workflow PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|workflowStatus|Pending (Update)|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	Then Page view With Workflow PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|workflowStatus|Pending (Update)|
Scenario: View Approved Page After Staging Deactivated
Priority: 5
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	And these variables
		|pageName|New Site Page Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Staging submit For Publication Page Revision
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page view With Workflow PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|workflowStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|${pageName}|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|${pageName}|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page view With Workflow PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|workflowStatus|Ready for Publication|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And ProductMenu goto Staging Site
		|site|${siteName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging deactivate Staging CP
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow goto Assigned To Me
	And Workflow view Completed Tasks Task Not Present CP
		|workflowAssetTitle|${pageName}|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	Then Page delete PG
		|pageName|${pageName}|
Scenario: Withdraw Workflow Submission From Removed User
Priority: 2
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|user@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|user@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit User Site CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User assign Site Role CP
		|siteRoleName|Site Administrator|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|user@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And Staging submit For Publication Page Revision
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|Test Test|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Site Page Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Page Revision|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow reject Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Site Page Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Page Revision|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|No Workflow|
		|workflowResourceValue|Page Revision|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User deactivate CP
		|userFirstName|userfn|
	And User delete CP
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|Workflow Submissions|
	And Workflow withdraw Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Site Page Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Page Revision|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver|
		|workflowTask|Update|
	Then Workflow view Default Workflow Submissions

